# Kimi K2.8 Preview — findings by Inkling 2 Small

- Source: Moonshot AI / Kimi (`kimi-for-coding`, "K2.8 Preview")
- Date: 2026-11-13 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview (served as `kimi-for-coding` in Kimi Code)
- **Short description:** Moonshot AI's coding and agent model behind the `kimi-for-coding` ID in Kimi Code — Moonshot positions it as "performance close to K3 with more efficient thinking", aimed at code completion and routine development tasks. Preview; not open weights; API-only via Kimi Code membership.
- **Provider / access:** Kimi Code (Moonshot AI), subscription membership only — Kimi Code Console (`https://www.kimi.com/code/console`), Base URLs `https://api.kimi.com/coding/v1` (China) / `https://api.kimi.ai/coding/v1` (overseas) for OpenAI Responses/Chat Completions, or Anthropic-compatible `https://api.kimi.com/coding/` / `https://api.kimi.ai/coding/`. Plus tier and above; 1M context window requires Plus/legacy Allegretto+. Not available on OpenCode Zen, OpenRouter, or as a pay-per-token public API (checked 2026-11-13).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-11 (rolled out to all Kimi Code users; model ID unchanged). Moonshot has not published a knowledge cutoff.
- **IDs:** `kimi-for-coding` (Kimi Code membership; third-party tools must use this ID). Mistyped IDs fall back to K2.8 Preview without thinking. Not listed under a standalone `kimi-k2.8-preview` API route.
- **Context window:** up to 1,048,576 tokens (Plus tier and above; 1M for higher tiers). Thinking effort `low` / `high` / `max`, default `max`; disable-thinking requests are served by K2.8 Preview without thinking.
- **Modalities:** text / image / video in → text out; reasoning yes (default `max`); tool calling in Kimi Code clients; multimodal input per Kimi Code model table (image, video).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** Kimi Code membership subscription only — no pay-per-token price published; exact plan pricing is on the Kimi Code pricing page and is not restated here. Not free; not open weights.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed — Moonshot published no parameter count, architecture, or model card for this ID.

### Raw benchmarks found

ZERO verified public benchmark numbers found for `kimi-for-coding` / Kimi K2.8 Preview (the exact model/ID). Moonshot's only public performance claim is "close to Kimi K3 with more efficient thinking" (no numbers, no harness). Confirmed via: Kimi Code official model-configuration docs and What's New page; BenchmarkList (0 benchmark rows, "0 score rows", price not published, released 2026-09-11); BenchLM 404 (no page); LLM Stats (specs and latency, no benchmark table); Stealth Models (no measured entry); DuckDuckGo search for benchmark queries (no primary-source results). No values are reproducible for this exact ID.

